WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.433
One sentence, and an app appears on a phone.

2
00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:08.700
By the end, you will have made one, changed it, and seen it on Android and iOS.

3
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.900
You write no code.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.446
First, start the simulator.

5
00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:16.330
It is a phone that runs in your browser.

6
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.925
Type npm run sim, and leave it open.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.655
Next, connect your assistant.

8
00:00:24.655 --> 00:00:28.889
Type npx shipvo agents setup, then restart the assistant.

9
00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:33.050
Now it has Shipvo tools, like create_app and update_app.

10
00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.531
Now ask, in your own words.

11
00:00:36.531 --> 00:00:38.065
Make a gift ideas app.

12
00:00:38.065 --> 00:00:41.618
I want to write who each idea is for, and the idea.

13
00:00:41.618 --> 00:00:44.127
Shipvo checks the description first.

14
00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.775
Then the app opens, with its own icon.

15
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:50.157
Use it.

16
00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:53.999
Ask the assistant to add an idea, Mum, garden gloves.

17
00:00:53.999 --> 00:00:55.521
It shows in the list.

18
00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:57.333
Keep an eye on this idea.

19
00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:59.000
It matters in a moment.

20
00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:03.062
Now ask for a change.

21
00:01:03.062 --> 00:01:06.086
Add an About screen, and a button to open it.

22
00:01:06.086 --> 00:01:07.700
The app changes at once.

23
00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:09.716
And Mum's idea is still there.

24
00:01:09.716 --> 00:01:11.800
Shipvo keeps what people typed.

25
00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:18.077
Want the iPhone look?

26
00:01:18.077 --> 00:01:19.979
Ask again with the iOS look.

27
00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:25.075
The same description gives you an Android app and an iOS app, side by side.

28
00:01:29.650 --> 00:01:31.881
That is an app from one sentence.

29
00:01:31.881 --> 00:01:33.640
Try it in your own folder.

30
00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:37.494
The step by step guide is at shipvo.dev/learn.

31
00:01:37.494 --> 00:01:40.875
Next, see your own app on a phone with shipvo run.
